# Optional. If set, the app fetches its product catalog from the backend
# (see /server) on load instead of using the bundled src/data/products.js.
# If unset, or if the fetch fails for any reason, the app silently falls
# back to the local data — it always works either way.
#
# Copy this file to .env and start the server (see server/README or the
# root README's "Backend (bonus)" section), then set:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
